---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Support" description="How Statecraft Systems clients get help: contact, response times and billing.">
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Support</span>
    <h1>Need something changed or fixed?</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap split">
    <div class="left"><h2>Reach us</h2></div>
    <div class="right prose">
      <p><strong>Email.</strong> <a href="mailto:m@statecraft.systems">m@statecraft.systems</a>. Tell us which site, what you need, and add screenshots or photos if they help.</p>
      <p><strong>Your project room.</strong> If you have a project room, you can send answers, updates and photos there too. Use the link from your proposal.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap split">
    <div class="left"><h2>Response times</h2></div>
    <div class="right prose">
      <p>We reply within <strong>2 business days</strong>. If a site is down, the same or next business day.</p>
      <p>Small changes are usually done within a few business days. Bigger requests get a short written quote first, and nothing is charged until you approve it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap split">
    <div class="left"><h2>Billing</h2></div>
    <div class="right prose">
      <p>Update your card, download invoices and receipts, or cancel your plan in the <a href="https://billing.stripe.com/p/login/3cI8wPbAD6LM5FC9t15Ne00">Stripe billing portal</a>. Sign in with your billing email.</p>
      <p>Questions about a charge? Email us and we'll sort it out.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap split">
    <div class="left"><h2>The details</h2></div>
    <div class="right prose">
      <p><a href="/terms/">Terms of service</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></p>
      <p>Statecraft Systems LLC · <a href="mailto:m@statecraft.systems">m@statecraft.systems</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
